oeba.org/sentences/show/342682\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">去年</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょねん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">去年</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197333\">ビルは<ruby>去年<rp>(</rp><rt>きょねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>秋<rp>(</rp><rt>あき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">比尔去年秋天来见我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">拒否</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょひ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拒绝；否决；回绝</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"237019\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>質問<rp>(</rp><rt>しつもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>答<rp>(</rp><rt>こた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えることを<ruby>拒否<rp>(</rp><rt>きょひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我拒绝回答这个问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">許容</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">许可；允许；认可；容忍；宽恕</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">距離</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">距离；射程；间隔；（意见等的）差异；隔阂；距离感；度量</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"235233\">４マイルはかなりの<ruby>距離<rp>(</rp><rt>きょり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">四英里是相当的距离。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">寄与</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きよ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">贡献；服务</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205093\">それは<ruby>社会<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>寄与<rp>(</rp><rt>きよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するのだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这对社会有贡献。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">清い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きよい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">洁净；清澈；纯洁；清廉；清白；无辜；柏拉图式的；贞洁</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">器用</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">灵巧；灵活；敏捷；娴熟；手巧；机巧；精明；巧妙</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195374\">マックスは<ruby>手先<rp>(</rp><rt>てさき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>器用<rp>(</rp><rt>きよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">麦克斯是用手的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">清らか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きよらか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">清澈；清净；纯洁；清廉；清廉；天真无邪；柏拉图式的；贞洁</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">嫌い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きらい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">厌恶；讨厌；不喜欢；倾向；带有…的意味；些许；区别；辨别</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76676\">ジムくんは<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎの<ruby>嫌<rp>(</rp><rt>きら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">吉姆先生不喜欢过度去。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">嫌う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きらう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">讨厌；厌恶；憎恶；回避；躲避；不顾；不在乎；漠视；有害于；对…不利</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"88447\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人前<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとまえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をするのを<ruby>嫌<rp>(</rp><rt>きら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她不喜欢在人面前说话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-he